{"detail": {"templateUuid": "10d85d4fee1e472981bdd17f41709074", "projectUuid": "efb484d5f5b94bef95a1dc950b332851", "name": "《粽享丝滑》端午粽子食礼TVC广告片", "description": "《粽享丝滑》东方端午食礼TVC广告片，是一支以端午粽子为核心的东方美学影像作品。影片围绕“粽叶、山水、龙舟、手作、沸煮、开粽、食礼与品牌定帧”展开，从自然寻源到端午文化，从匠心包制到沸煮生香，再到开粽品鉴与东方留白收束，构建出一条完整的端午食礼视觉叙事。\n\n画面以深绿色东方背景、金色微光、电影级微距、水汽蒸腾、粽叶水光、糯米拉丝与山水云雾为核心视觉语言，强调克制、温润、诗意和节令仪式感。整支片子不依赖旁白和卖点式表达，而是通过镜头运动、材质细节、光影层次和节奏递进，呈现端午粽子的东方风味与品牌记忆点。影片在东方留白与端午食礼氛围中完成品牌收束，形成一支兼具节日氛围、食物质感与TVC广告片气质的端午粽子影像作品", "coverUrl": "/assets/e1775954c4ab95a5.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/605c133411b74a8b8092650ab2a83808/5053066c6347e33e4c84a96c047a5a39ae6c9c0d.mp4", "snapshotId": 20527, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1249552, "ownerUuid": "605c133411b74a8b8092650ab2a83808", "avatar": "/assets/76937f0200c94087.webp", "nickname": "像素农夫DESIGN", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 164, "tags": [{"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3041, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-创意TVC", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3041", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "scor